 young (point 7), and Fiona is white (point 6), it follows that all young things are white.\n- From point 9, all young, white things are cold. Since Erin is white (point 4) and we have established that all young things are white, it follows that Erin is cold.\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, the statement "Erin is cold" is true.\n\n<｜User｜>The statement "Erin is cold" is true.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
