 and all green things are furry.\n   - Since Harry is green, it must be furry.\n   - Since Harry is not red, it cannot be red.\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, the statement "Harry is red" is false.\n\n<｜User｜>The statement "Harry is red" is false.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
