Erin must be young.\n   - Since Erin is young, according to the fifth relationship, Erin must be blue.\n   - Since Erin is blue, according to the sixth relationship, Erin must be quiet.\n   - Since Erin is quiet, according to the seventh relationship, Erin must be furry.\n   - Since Erin is furry, according to the eighth relationship, Erin must be young.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**.\n   - Erin is big.\n   - Erin is blue.\n   - Erin is quiet.\n   - Erin is smart.\n   - Erin is young.\n   - Erin is furry. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
