int 15, if Bob is furry, then Bob is green. Since Anne is furry, we can infer that Anne is green.\n- From point 16, rough things are green. Since Anne is rough, we can confirm that Anne is green.\n- From point 17, if something is kind and not furry then it is green. Since Anne is not kind (because red things are not kind), we can confirm that Anne is green.\n- From point 18, all quiet things are cold. Since Anne is not quiet (because green, rough things are quiet), we can confirm that Anne is not cold. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
